   "benefits": [
    "Deeply stretches the spine, shoulders, and hamstrings",
    "Calms the mind"
   ],
   "caution": "Keep your head still looking straight up; rest feet on a chair or block if they don't reach the floor, and avoid if you have neck or spine injury."
